OL,3,GNEWSA'Inconceivable' that Irish
OL,4,Agovernment would not hold Omagh inquiry
OL,5,A- Sir Chris Bryant
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is "almost inconceivable" that the
OL,8,FRepublic of Ireland would not hold an
OL,9,Finquiry into the Omagh bombing, the
OL,10,Fsecretary of state for Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FSir Chris Bryant urged Irish ministers
OL,14,Fon Thursday to hold an inquiry when
OL,15,Fthey met for the British Irish
OL,16,FIntergovernmental Conference.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
