OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Inconceivable' that Irish
OL,4,Agovernment would not hold Omagh inquiry
OL,5,A- Sir Chris Bryant
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, the Taoiseach (Irish prime
OL,8,Fminister) Micheal Martin said he was
OL,9,Fnot contemplating a separate public
OL,10,Finquiry "at the moment", however
OL,11,FIreland's justice minister said he has
OL,12,Fan "open mind" to a second inquiry.
OL,14,FThe Omagh Bombing Inquiry is
OL,15,Finvestigating whether the attack on 15
OL,16,FAugust 1998, in which 29 people
OL,17,Fincluding a woman pregnant with twins
OL,18,Fwere killed, could have been prevented.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
